# vvaharness/util/logs.py

Structured logging for the package: key-value lines on standard error, JSON lines to an optional log file, and every field redacted. No decision of the pipeline depends on it.

Source: `vvaharness/util/logs.py` (lines 1-235)
Executor: code
Called from: every module (`logs.get_logger(__name__)`); `configure` from the command-line entry point

